{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survival Tech is a cozy survival adventure about hiking and camping your way to Grandma\u2019s house. <strong>Wishlist today!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set up camp to rest, and explore to gather resources to prepare for the journey ahead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976010/extras/38c403689ddbbf22c16ea2c7cdfd70ef.poster.avif?t=1757248362\" aria-label=\"Clip of player exploring tiles around base camp\" width=834 height=468 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976010/extras/38c403689ddbbf22c16ea2c7cdfd70ef.webm?t=1757248362\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976010/extras/38c403689ddbbf22c16ea2c7cdfd70ef.mp4?t=1757248362\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sharpen your survival skills with mini-games: navigate using the stars or the rising sun, or be delayed on your journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976010/extras/e92450324031fe8b3ff254bfe2804bfd.avif?t=1757248362\" alt=\"Navigation mini game where you find the North Star\" width=1167 height=655 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hike  to move closer to Grandma, but try not to turn your journey into a cautionary tale!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976010/extras/edb1b0dfe5d21a8e0b1d73e6b009b61d.poster.avif?t=1757248362\" aria-label=\"Clip of player hiking to Grandma&#039;s\" width=834 height=468 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976010/extras/edb1b0dfe5d21a8e0b1d73e6b009b61d.webm?t=1757248362\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976010/extras/edb1b0dfe5d21a8e0b1d73e6b009b61d.mp4?t=1757248362\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If players enjoy this  hike, the adventure may expand into new biomes, crafting, and deeper survival systems.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Stretch Goals</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deeper survival skills</strong>: carve wood into tools,  track &amp; trap animals, practice first aid,  build fire, cook food, tie knots, and more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>New biomes</strong>: trek through deserts,  mountains, jungles,  coastlines, and more. One day, unlock Real-World Survival Mode: generate journeys between actual locations on a world map.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>More plants, animals, and encounters</strong>: a wider variety of discoveries in the wild, from the nourishing to the whimsical to the dangerous.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Observation &amp; deduction</strong>: use natural signs to guess what's around. For example, cattails hint at water nearby.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Procedurally generated exploration areas</strong>: larger areas around camp to explore with greater risks and rewards.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3976010?t=1757248362","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3976010?t=1757248362","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976010/e352bf07882788f201353ae2a9a6582ed65e430c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757248362","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976010/e352bf07882788f201353ae2a9a6582ed65e430c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757248362","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survival Tech is a cozy survival adventure about hiking and camping your way to Grandma\u2019s house. <strong>Wishlist today!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set up camp to rest, and explore to gather resources to prepare for the journey ahead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976010/extras/38c403689ddbbf22c16ea2c7cdfd70ef.poster.avif?t=1757248362\" aria-label=\"Clip of player exploring tiles around base camp\" width=834 height=468 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976010/extras/38c403689ddbbf22c16ea2c7cdfd70ef.webm?t=1757248362\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976010/extras/38c403689ddbbf22c16ea2c7cdfd70ef.mp4?t=1757248362\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sharpen your survival skills with mini-games: navigate using the stars or the rising sun, or be delayed on your journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976010/extras/e92450324031fe8b3ff254bfe2804bfd.avif?t=1757248362\" alt=\"Navigation mini game where you find the North Star\" w